{"4411840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Yellowcreek Stories - The Cabin Watcher", "steam_appid": 4411840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A stormy night. A remote mountain cabin.</strong><br><strong>Someone is watching you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A masked killer stalks the area and <strong>reacts to sound, light, and movement</strong>.<br><strong>No combat. No second chances.</strong> Survival is about staying unseen, keeping calm, and making the right call under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411840/extras/54207b565e6458e5f5bfc8b4f64d4c1f.poster.avif?t=1786017752\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411840/extras/54207b565e6458e5f5bfc8b4f64d4c1f.webm?t=1786017752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411840/extras/54207b565e6458e5f5bfc8b4f64d4c1f.mp4?t=1786017752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive by mastering</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Noise:</strong> every action matters — loud mistakes draw attention</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light:</strong> your flashlight can save you… or expose you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement:</strong> sprinting is risky; careful steps keep you alive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hiding:</strong> when you’re spotted, you’re already behind</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The killer <strong>actively searches based on your behavior</strong>, turning every encounter into a tense mind game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for <strong>one intense sitting </strong> — escalating tension, no filler, no downtime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411840/extras/4ca1481e573ca3543559246e57941e5b.poster.avif?t=1786017752\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411840/extras/4ca1481e573ca3543559246e57941e5b.webm?t=1786017752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411840/extras/4ca1481e573ca3543559246e57941e5b.mp4?t=1786017752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person <strong>stealth slasher</strong> inspired by classic 80s horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth built around <strong>sound, light, and movement</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reactive enemy behavior</strong> and search patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal HUD with <strong>real-time noise/visibility feedback</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive cinematic moments</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A stormy night. A remote mountain cabin.</strong><br><strong>Someone is watching you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A masked killer stalks the area and <strong>reacts to sound, light, and movement</strong>.<br><strong>No combat. No second chances.</strong> Survival is about staying unseen, keeping calm, and making the right call under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411840/extras/54207b565e6458e5f5bfc8b4f64d4c1f.poster.avif?t=1786017752\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411840/extras/54207b565e6458e5f5bfc8b4f64d4c1f.webm?t=1786017752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411840/extras/54207b565e6458e5f5bfc8b4f64d4c1f.mp4?t=1786017752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive by mastering</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Noise:</strong> every action matters — loud mistakes draw attention</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light:</strong> your flashlight can save you… or expose you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement:</strong> sprinting is risky; careful steps keep you alive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hiding:</strong> when you’re spotted, you’re already behind</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The killer <strong>actively searches based on your behavior</strong>, turning every encounter into a tense mind game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for <strong>one intense sitting </strong> — escalating tension, no filler, no downtime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411840/extras/4ca1481e573ca3543559246e57941e5b.poster.avif?t=1786017752\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411840/extras/4ca1481e573ca3543559246e57941e5b.webm?t=1786017752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411840/extras/4ca1481e573ca3543559246e57941e5b.mp4?t=1786017752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" 